03:14:39.960 --> 03:14:42.980
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Even in Times Square branch, she has no authority.

03:14:43.780 --> 03:15:06.800
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay, we're done with authority when it comes to transactions. How about in contracts po? Given the investment that you confirmed that the Vice President has in GenCorp Industries Inc., what is her... authority to represent GenCorp Industries Inc. with respect to contracts, whether private or public, if at all.

