03:32:42.180 --> 03:33:00.960
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: How about in the year 2023? Kinumpirman niyo din po na director ang ating vicepresidente. What is the participation? or involvement of the Vice President in the business, meetings, or transactions of the Board of Directors of Metro City Chow Foods Corporation in the year 2023 specifically.

03:33:01.960 --> 03:33:10.580
