03:33:16.970 --> 03:33:32.350
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: How about in the year 2024 po, Atty. Suzette? Same question, what is the participation or involvement of the vice president, Sara Zimmerman Duterte, in the business, meetings, or transactions of the board of directors of Metro City Chow Foods Corporation?

03:33:33.070 --> 03:33:36.190
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: She still has no involvement, sir, in 2024.

03:33:38.040 --> 03:33:53.450
