03:33:53.950 --> 03:33:59.550
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: She has no involvement. She did not attend any meetings in 2025.

03:34:00.550 --> 03:34:20.110
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now, it would now seem, attorney, that from 2022 to 2025, wala pong participation or involvement yung vice-presidente. Again, can you please explain to us why in all these years, the vice-president has no participation or involvement? in the meetings of the board of directors of metro city chow foods corporation

03:34:20.110 --> 03:34:39.440
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: she does not attend the meetings and i haven't seen her uh attend any company gatherings or like in the christmas party i don't i don't see her she she is not involved really in the business

03:34:39.440 --> 03:34:49.230
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: now what is her given that what is her um what is his her participation in the decision making process

03:34:50.470 --> 03:34:53.350
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: She does not participate in the decision-making process.

03:34:53.350 --> 03:35:01.530
