03:35:34.150 --> 03:36:02.770
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Because I have attended meetings, I have attended board meetings also, and she is not there, and there were, actually there were two significant... incidents in the branch last year and I actually asked if what would be the effect to the vice president and the operations manager said that wala man na siya nag-apil-apil jud you ever since.

