03:37:33.600 --> 03:37:38.180
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: What do you mean by that, Atty. Suzette? Can you please explain further?

03:37:38.740 --> 03:38:13.190
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: So, these positions in the Executive Committee The Compensation Committee and other committees. Actually, these are not in the bylaws of the corporation. And actually, when I inquired further why there are positions in the Executive Committee, so the accounting staff said that the bank will not accept the GIS with empty positions. So, all of the directors must have a position in the Executive Committee.

03:38:13.690 --> 03:38:16.950
