Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay. You mentioned and you confirmed just now that the Vice President is in fact declared as a member of the Compensation Committee but that there is no Compensation Committee under the company's bylaws. Now in the years 2022, what is the participation or involvement of the Vice President in the business or transactions of that Compensation Committee?

