03:43:31.800 --> 03:43:52.280
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Again, without exposing the corporation to liquidated damages, this is all we want to know. What is the contribution? If any of the vice president in the franchise fee and capital investment needed for that specific Chowking branch that as you said is already operated by Metro City Chow Foods Corporation?

03:43:52.920 --> 03:43:59.480
