03:44:34.310 --> 03:44:49.840
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: How is that? Paid up capital of 12,500 in the corporation by the vice president. How can that be used or how is that being used by the corporation in relation to the capital investment needed for the Chowking branch? If you know and if any.

03:44:50.080 --> 03:44:57.760
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Well, the franchise fee is granted to the corporation so it will be the corporation who will pay the franchise fee.

03:44:58.120 --> 03:45:02.340
