04:32:43.160 --> 04:32:46.340
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: The SEC records, Your Honor. SEC

04:32:46.340 --> 04:32:47.520
Sen. Panfilo “Ping” M. Lacson: records? Are you sure?

