04:33:09.160 --> 04:33:09.180
Sen. Panfilo “Ping” M. Lacson: Alam

04:33:09.180 --> 04:33:15.030
Sen. Panfilo “Ping” M. Lacson: ko po, mas may probative weight or admissibility weight yung admission against interest.

04:33:17.170 --> 04:33:27.980
