04:33:39.460 --> 04:33:40.620
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Yes, Attorney Justin.

04:33:40.820 --> 04:33:53.340
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: With due respect, Your Honor, with all due respect, of course, to the queries and the interest of the good Senators, but we have to be clear, Your Honor. Admission against interest is not a rule.

04:33:54.970 --> 04:34:23.600
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: On probative value, Your Honor, it is an exception to the hearsay rule, Your Honor. In other words, Your Honor, comparing pieces of evidence and statements and the probative weight thereof, with all due respect, is done by the respective court, and in this case, the senator-judges. But just for the record, Your Honor, admissions against interest is not a rule on determining probative weight. It is an exception. to the hearsay rule. Just for the record.

04:34:23.800 --> 04:34:34.580
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: As stated by the court, as stated by the presiding officer, that is subject to the appreciation of each senator judge with respect to the evidence being presented. Move on, Attorney Lorna.

04:34:35.180 --> 04:35:28.270
Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: Just to make a counter-manifestation, Your Honor, because counsel made a manifestation that admission has no probative value. May I call the court's attention and rightly point it out by Senator Ping. Admission in the hierarchy of evidence is the highest. It is the highest in terms of hierarchy of evidence. And to that, I will quote Section 27 of the Rules of Court. Section 27 on testimonial evidence saying that the act, act, declaration, which is the solid, the act, declaration, or omission of a party, to a relevant fact may be given in evidence against him or her. That is section 27. So, if I may, Your Honor.

04:35:28.530 --> 04:35:57.340
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Everybody actually is correct. Nobody is wrong. Attorney Justin is correct in that admission against interest is indeed an exception to the hearsay rule. Attorney Lorna is likewise correct that admission per se has been characterized in fact as the queen of evidence will carry more probative... Wait, especially if it comes from the accused. Let's move on, counsel. This is not for us to decide, but for each individual judge to appreciate and decide.

04:35:57.820 --> 04:37:15.860
