04:55:49.400 --> 04:55:56.320
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: She is not in the GIS of GenCorp because she is not a stockholder.

04:55:57.540 --> 04:55:58.260
Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: She

04:55:59.890 --> 04:56:23.290
Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: is not a stockholder per the GIS but she is a stockholder per her declaration or admission in her statement of assets and liabilities. Madam Witness.

04:56:23.690 --> 04:56:25.190
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: What is the question, Your Honor?

04:56:25.370 --> 04:56:46.770
Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: The question is, how will you, as an expert, no, not as an expert, having dealt with companies and also being an accountant yourself, How would you reconcile this discrepancy? If any, if you can.

04:56:47.130 --> 04:57:00.250
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Your Honor, apologies and with all due respect to the counsel for the prosecution. I think this is connected already and had already been answered by the witness in a previous answer. She already explained that she cannot answer for the Vice President, Your Honor.

04:57:02.740 --> 04:57:03.260
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: In

04:57:03.260 --> 04:57:03.600
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: respect

04:57:03.600 --> 04:57:05.260
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: to clarifying that. So

04:57:05.260 --> 04:57:12.710
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: to ask the witness how you can reconcile that. In consistency, the witness already answered. She cannot answer for the vice president.

04:57:13.070 --> 04:57:20.470
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: To abbreviate, counsels, to abbreviate the proceedings, and I guess this is in the mind of some of the senator judges as well.

04:57:22.080 --> 04:57:35.810
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Attorney Suzette, sabi niyo, return of capital, at sabi niyo anong kapital yun? Davao Bounty. Sa Davao Bounty, ang binayaran lamang ng vice president, ayon sa record, ay 48,000.

04:57:35.850 --> 04:57:38.010
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Yung binibigay ng

04:57:39.450 --> 04:57:44.010
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: GenCorp Times Square Branch Jollibee sa kanya mula 2022.

04:57:45.610 --> 04:58:16.530
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: 45x na, 45 times na nung kanyang investment sa Davao Bounty. Hindi na po ito and please take note of the preposition I will use. Hindi na po ito return of investment. Return on investment na po ito. Return of investment, hindi po ba? Ginamit nyo kasi kanina, return of investment eh. Binalik yung ininvest.

04:58:18.190 --> 04:59:01.250
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Binalik yung kapital lang. Return on investment, may kita na yung kapital. Kasi nga, yung binayaran lang ng vice president ayon sa dokumento ay 48,000 sa Davao bounty. Ngayon, posibleng may ibang dahilan na hindi nyo alam. At ang sagot nyo, Hindi nyo nga alam kung ano pa yung iba. To your knowledge, ito lang po yun. So base sa sagot nyo, hindi lang po ito return of investment, return on investment na po ito, maliba na lang kung may alam pa kayo at masasabing iba pang investment ng Vice President na binabalik. Kung wala na po, then we will leave it at that. Wala na po, Atty. Suzette?

04:59:01.730 --> 04:59:02.530
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Wala na po.

04:59:02.950 --> 04:59:09.000
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Wala kayong alam. Pero posibleng meron, hindi nyo lang alam. Would that be a fair statement?

04:59:09.180 --> 04:59:14.740
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Hindi ko nga po alam kung meron because I could not verify it from other records.

04:59:16.260 --> 04:59:19.240
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: That's the answer of the witness counsel. Move on, Attorney Lorna.

04:59:19.500 --> 04:59:31.680
Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: Whether it be in line with the questioning of the presiding officer, whether it be a return on investment or

04:59:33.470 --> 04:59:42.160
Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: a return of investment, Madam Counsel, you are following. It is still income, correct?

04:59:44.640 --> 04:59:50.800
Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: Yes. Whether binalik yung ininvest mo, binalik yan. Income yan.

04:59:51.260 --> 04:59:56.500
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: With the indulgence of Attorney Lorna, what is the pleasure of Senator Judge Rafi?

04:59:57.000 --> 04:59:58.720
