05:01:05.300 --> 05:01:05.920
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes, Your Honor.

05:01:06.200 --> 05:01:09.100
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: So may cancel check yun. Nakita mo ba yung cancel check?

05:01:09.300 --> 05:01:10.080
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: No, I did not.

05:01:10.360 --> 05:01:43.230
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: No, you should have asked a copy of that cancel check. Kasi alam mo, magkitistigo ngayon dito. You should have asked for the contract. Na ito yung return of investment, sige nasa niyong kontrata. Kung walang kontrata, nasaan yung cancel check? Kasi sa cancel check, sa cheque, nilalagay doon kung para saan yung binabayad sa kanya. Tama? So you should at least ask from GEMCOR a copy of that cancel check. Para pagpunta mo rito, readyng ready ka na. It seems to me, 15 years ka abogado, mukhang hindi ka pa ready. Or, nagmamangmangan lang po kayo. Maraming salamat po.

05:01:43.470 --> 05:01:47.750
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: The remarks of the gentleman are noted. Atty. Kapunan, your witness.

05:01:48.290 --> 05:01:49.210
Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: Madam Witness.

05:01:51.150 --> 05:02:01.090
Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: Whether it is a return of investment which now is becoming clear that it is not because

05:02:03.290 --> 05:02:46.010
Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: yung 2 million na yan hindi ma-reconcile sa 40 something thousand lang na-invest niya, correct? It is a return of investment or a return on investment which means She invested as either creditor, nagpahiram, or shareholder siya, or ito ay bayad sa utang sa kanya kung nagpa-utang siya, or declared as dividend. Whether, regardless of the characterization, it is income, correct?

05:02:46.590 --> 05:02:48.250
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: As an answer, Your Honor.

05:02:49.120 --> 05:02:50.440
Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: I haven't heard your answer yet.

05:02:50.460 --> 05:02:52.520
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Not yet. Kindly answer, Atty. Suzette.

05:02:53.230 --> 05:02:54.770
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: I answered yes, Your Honor.

05:02:54.910 --> 05:02:55.750
Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: So it is income.

05:02:56.190 --> 05:03:04.180
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: With the permission of Atty. Lornas, Sen. Judge Bam wishes to make... I mean, what is your pleasure, sir?

05:03:04.180 --> 05:03:08.300
