05:04:10.220 --> 05:04:13.380
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Pumunta ka dito with these numbers, di mo alam kung paano nakuha yung mga numero.

05:04:13.980 --> 05:04:17.860
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: I requested for data extraction for 2022 to 2025.

05:04:19.200 --> 05:04:22.480
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Okay. Your witness, Attorney Lorna.

05:04:29.150 --> 05:04:31.950
Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: Madam Witness, regardless

05:04:36.750 --> 05:04:47.450
Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: of the amount, Madam Witness, it could be 43,000, it could be 2 million, it could be more, it could be less. It still is income, correct?

05:04:49.110 --> 05:04:49.710
Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: Correct.

05:04:51.400 --> 05:04:53.280
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: I already answered yes, Your Honor.

05:04:53.300 --> 05:04:53.560
Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: Okay.

05:04:53.600 --> 05:04:54.780
Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: And as income,

05:04:56.900 --> 05:04:58.060
Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: It should be declared.

05:04:59.600 --> 05:05:00.360
Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: Correct?

05:05:00.900 --> 05:05:02.320
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes. Okay.

05:05:02.440 --> 05:05:09.540
