05:06:02.700 --> 05:06:05.440
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: I prefer not to answer, Your Honor.

05:06:07.000 --> 05:06:08.780
Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: You prefer not to answer?

05:06:09.240 --> 05:06:12.720
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Iba yung you prefer not to answer sa you don't know, Atty. Suzette.

05:06:13.000 --> 05:06:14.360
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: I don't know, Your Honor.

05:06:20.670 --> 05:06:22.270
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: You've made your point, Atty. Lorna.

05:06:22.550 --> 05:06:22.990
Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: Okay.

05:06:26.550 --> 05:06:51.440
Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: You prefer not to answer. Why? Why do you prefer not to answer when you're here? Precisely for the purpose of clarifying the situation. Is the Vice President in violation of the Constitution by not declaring income which she received from sources other than her salary? It's

05:06:51.440 --> 05:06:54.760
Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: a clear question. Why can you not answer that?

