05:10:58.140 --> 05:11:00.080
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Already answered, counsel. She said some.

05:11:00.180 --> 05:11:00.880
Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: There are interlocks.

05:11:02.330 --> 05:11:04.470
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Kindly move on, Attorney Lorna. She already answered.

05:11:07.260 --> 05:11:34.270
Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: And in this interlocks, there is a family name that appears. Correct? Very, as a dominant shareholder, the name of JTC. JTC Corporation, or the name of the person, Jaime D. Cruz. Correct?

05:11:34.550 --> 05:11:35.550
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Correct, Your Honor.

