05:11:49.670 --> 05:11:58.150
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Misleading, Your Honor. There is no prior testimony. That the witness stated that she is the counsel of Jaime T. Cruz himself.

05:11:58.890 --> 05:12:03.050
Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: She's the counsel of GenCorp. We

