Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Although, although, although indeed nothing has been mentioned about it, the witness indeed admitted earlier that she's the in-house counsel of other corporations. and that the incorporator of those other corporations is Jaime T. Cruz as well. So, with your indulgence, Atty. Justine, I'll allow it. Witness may answer.

