Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Yes, Your Honor. But I only ask that Atty. Capunan, with all due respect, lay the basis.

05:12:38.610 --> 05:12:43.290
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Yes, kindly answer, Atty. Suzette.

05:12:45.170 --> 05:13:01.630
