05:13:50.390 --> 05:14:13.290
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Your Honor, pardon. I will have to invoke this court's own ruling, dated November 5, 2026, where it excluded documents... from the offer pertaining to JTC Group of Companies and Pikimong Pikimong. What am I trying to say, Your Honor? The subject matter being discussed now has already been excluded by this honorable court, Your Honor.

