05:14:33.500 --> 05:14:35.120
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: We submit and we understand, Your Honor.

05:14:35.260 --> 05:14:43.060
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: So yung predecessor companies, Jaime T. Cruz sa nakalabas, GenCorp now is owned principally, biggest shareholder, JTC, correct?

05:14:43.320 --> 05:14:43.900
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes, Your Honor.

05:14:44.160 --> 05:14:46.940
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Okay. Move on, Your Witness, Counsel.

