Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Apologies, Your Honor. I will have to object. Because it would now seem that the Council is testifying, not asking a question.

05:16:36.060 --> 05:16:43.380
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Barring the basis laid by attorney Kapunan for a question, the question is simply asking the witness to read a portion of the report.

05:16:43.990 --> 05:16:47.710
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Then I ask respectfully that she go directly to that point.

05:16:48.710 --> 05:16:50.090
