Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: Annual meetings, yes.

05:47:02.110 --> 05:47:05.970
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: You're talking year to year to year. I'm sorry,

05:47:06.070 --> 05:47:12.550
Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: I'm confused. In a year, how many shareholders' meetings would Metro have?

05:47:14.070 --> 05:47:18.730
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: In a year, I do not know the exact number of meetings.

05:47:19.930 --> 05:47:22.450
