Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Yes, Your Honor. In that case, Your Honor, then we'll have to clarify because it's a tax code, branch code, not a franchise which was raised, not a separate franchise which was purported in the question earlier. Because tax code lang po, branch code. That's why we wanted to confirm where that is coming from. And I hope this court understands because those are allegations. That we deserve to meet as the defense counsel.

