06:24:21.390 --> 06:24:24.780
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: But it's not. So there's no meaning to it. It's just...

06:24:24.830 --> 06:24:25.630
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: As

06:24:25.630 --> 06:24:27.310
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: I

06:24:27.310 --> 06:24:33.850
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: said, corporation law. What are the functions of a corporate secretary?

06:24:35.760 --> 06:24:46.960
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: To do the minutes of meetings, send notifications to the stockholders, keep corporate records, and a lot more, Your Honor.

06:24:47.700 --> 06:24:50.740
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: Who's the corporate secretary of GenCorp?

06:24:51.140 --> 06:24:52.500
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Ms. Girlie De La Cruz.

06:24:55.290 --> 06:24:59.750
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: Girlie Dela Cruz. Who is the corporate secretary of Metro Chow?

06:24:59.990 --> 06:25:01.710
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: The same, Girlie Dela Cruz.

06:25:02.050 --> 06:25:02.470
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: Same.

06:25:05.120 --> 06:25:24.950
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: As far as I know, and addressing the defense, it is the corporate secretary who records the attendance of board members and as well as their compensation. I was wondering why these details are being testified by an in-house counsel.

06:25:27.450 --> 06:25:32.510
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: Bakit? Why did they choose you instead of the Corporate Secretary of GenCorp to testify?

06:25:34.200 --> 06:25:36.560
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: I cannot answer why they chose me.

06:25:36.920 --> 06:25:54.890
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: Perhaps, Counsel Justin may be able to answer that. We're curious. Senator Sobiria and I are curious why. Why not the Corporate Secretary? She would be in a better perspective of all these questions being asked.

06:25:55.210 --> 06:25:56.150
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Maraming salamat

06:25:56.150 --> 06:26:18.440
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: po. Senator. And we do understand the concerns of the Senator judges. The defense only wishes if we could give one one-stop shop witness on these matters but unfortunately we can't. The reason why we presented Atty. Puna is because we determined her to be the best person from the persons from GenCorp, Your Honor. To be candid, Your Honor. To be direct.

06:26:21.150 --> 06:26:23.870
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: She has the most knowledge on these matters, Your Honor.

06:26:24.250 --> 06:26:27.190
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: Better than thee. Corporate Secretary.

06:26:27.370 --> 06:26:28.330
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: That is our assessment,

06:26:28.330 --> 06:26:28.650
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Your Honor.

06:26:28.730 --> 06:26:30.930
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: To be candid, Your Honor.

06:26:30.970 --> 06:26:35.770
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: Okay. That is your assessment. We will accept that.

06:26:37.950 --> 06:26:54.280
