06:26:56.660 --> 06:26:58.120
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: I agree, Your Honor.

06:26:58.420 --> 06:27:04.920
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: You agree? Correct. And you know, of course, that they have the same in-house counsel like you?

06:27:05.320 --> 06:27:06.280
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes, Your Honor.

06:27:06.540 --> 06:27:08.820
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: Same person filing in SEC?

06:27:09.840 --> 06:27:11.380
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: Same corporate secretary?

06:27:11.400 --> 06:27:12.260
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes, Your Honor.

06:27:12.380 --> 06:27:26.940
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: Yes, same corporate secretary, same company email address, same company telephone and mobile numbers, same contact persons, same independent auditors, and same chief financial officer. And your answer is?

06:27:27.790 --> 06:27:28.510
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes. Yes,

06:27:28.530 --> 06:27:28.830
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Your Honor.

06:27:28.990 --> 06:27:29.790
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: You agree with him?

06:27:30.730 --> 06:27:31.790
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: I agree, Your Honor.

06:27:32.010 --> 06:27:41.200
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: All right. Thank you. Thank you. Thank you, Senator Judge Sotto. Senator Ontiveros is recognized. You may proceed, ma'am. You have two minutes.

06:27:47.600 --> 06:27:52.140
