06:27:52.220 --> 06:27:53.220
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: May hapon, Your Honor.

06:27:53.540 --> 06:27:53.980
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Okay

06:27:53.980 --> 06:27:54.200
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: po.

06:27:57.870 --> 06:28:22.790
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Hindi ko na uusisain kung saan nyo nakuha, paano nyo binoo yung term na loose investment. Pero parang malinaw, that term only means na may ininvest si VP Sara Duterte. May ininvest siya na pera sa isang business na carryover sa GenCorp. Tama po?

06:28:23.110 --> 06:28:24.090
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes, Your Honor.

06:28:24.450 --> 06:28:33.750
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Okay, salamat. So, yung loose investment, nag-start po nung pang 2007. Pero noong 2022,

06:28:35.440 --> 06:28:38.540
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: 2023, 2024, 2025.

06:28:42.410 --> 06:28:53.450
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Kumita si VP Duterte nung total 2.14 million pesos dun sa tinawag niyong return of capital. Return of capital. Tama po?

06:28:53.710 --> 06:28:54.610
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes, Your Honor.

06:28:54.790 --> 06:28:55.030
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Yes.

06:28:56.930 --> 06:28:59.450
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: So, kumita nga siya. Tama po?

06:29:02.120 --> 06:29:02.820
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes.

06:29:03.040 --> 06:29:04.220
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Yes. Okay po.

06:29:06.010 --> 06:29:26.580
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: So, eto nga po eh, tumingin po ako sa records ng natanggap na pera ni VP Duterte mula sa Times Square. For four years, may monthly siya na natatanggap na pera. Parang kita o profits yan. So, hindi lang soli ng kapital.

06:29:28.100 --> 06:29:28.880
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: And

06:29:31.470 --> 06:29:42.520
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: nanote ko rin po, Atty. Suzette, na wala pong dividend declaration ang GenCorp. Mula nung kanyang incorporation, niminsan wala.

06:29:43.160 --> 06:29:43.880
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: At

06:29:43.880 --> 06:30:11.680
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: kung may natanggap si VP Duterte na returns o kung ano pa man ang tawag sa binibigay sa kanya na monthly, para pong lumalabas pa nga na preferred shareholder po siya. Preferred shareholder. Sa isang korporasyon na may mga undocumented, may mga informal na transaksyon. Dahil sabi nyo nga kanina, may mga maaaring nangyayari na hindi nyo nalalaman. So, parang

06:30:11.680 --> 06:30:11.900
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: preferred

06:30:11.900 --> 06:30:15.960
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: shareholder po. Anyway, to continue.

06:30:18.020 --> 06:30:18.720
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: So,

06:30:19.840 --> 06:30:41.550
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: ibig pong sabihin mula 2007 kung saan ipinasok yung loose investment. Hanggang 2024, kung kailan nagsimula yung buwanan na pag-disburse sa kaniya, may financial interest siya sa isang business. Tama po.

06:30:42.900 --> 06:30:44.260
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes. Yes, ma'am.

06:30:44.840 --> 06:30:45.440
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: At

06:30:45.830 --> 06:30:51.230
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: ang interest na yun ay yung business na na-carry over sa GenCorp. Tama po.

06:30:53.000 --> 06:30:53.600
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes.

06:30:53.900 --> 06:31:15.400
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Yes po. So, kahit... Indirect lang po or loose yung investment or business interest. Winding up on this question, Mr. Presiding Officer, whether sa GenCorp yan o sa old company, as a lawyer, Atty. Suzette, bawal po yan sa Constitution, di po ba?

06:31:18.810 --> 06:31:19.330
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: I

06:31:19.330 --> 06:31:20.530
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: am not sure, Your Honor.

06:31:21.210 --> 06:31:43.850
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Even I who am not a lawyer, I'm sure. Malinaw yung nakalagay po doon sa ating konstitusyon. The Vice President quote, shall not during said tenure directly or indirectly participate in any business. Tama po ba ako? I'm asking you again as a lawyer.

06:31:44.990 --> 06:31:45.750
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes,

06:31:47.380 --> 06:31:49.220
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: that's from the Constitution, Your Honor.

06:31:49.460 --> 06:31:51.900
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Yes, it is from the Constitution.

06:31:53.760 --> 06:31:56.620
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Last two questions on this topic, Mr. Presiding Officer.

06:31:56.740 --> 06:31:58.940
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: You may wind up, ma'am.

06:31:59.140 --> 06:32:06.780
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Wind up on this topic. Salamat, Mr. Presiding Officer. Personal po ba kayong magkakilala, Atty. Suzette, ni Vice President Duterte?

06:32:07.140 --> 06:32:07.860
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: No, Your Honor.

06:32:08.240 --> 06:32:12.020
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Kasi ilang beses po kanina ang tawag niyo sa kanya ay Sara.

06:32:13.320 --> 06:32:14.100
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes, Sara.

06:32:15.180 --> 06:32:15.620
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: But

06:32:15.620 --> 06:32:17.000
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: I do not know her personally.

06:32:17.260 --> 06:32:17.340
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: You

06:32:17.340 --> 06:32:20.060
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: don't know her personally. And lastly po sa paksang ito,

06:32:21.900 --> 06:32:34.960
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Well, alam niyo po ba na si VP Sara Duterte mismo ang nagdeklara sa kanyang SALEN na siya ay may business interest sa GenCorp Industries mula 2024 hanggang 2025?

06:32:35.900 --> 06:32:39.160
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes, from what I have learned from this impeachment proceedings siya.

06:32:39.320 --> 06:32:40.000
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Okay,

06:32:40.060 --> 06:33:07.570
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: so you have learned this from the impeachment proceedings or elsewhere. Pero ang sumatotal po ay kahit pa subukan ninyo, with all due respect, Sabihin na wala o merong business interest si VP Duterte sa GenCorp, she made an admission already for the record para sa ating kabatidang lahat. So initially, salamat kayo as Attorney Suzette. Salamat po Mr. President.

06:33:07.590 --> 06:33:13.270
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Thank you, Senator Judge Riza, Senator Judge Villanueva. Attorney Lorna, you may sit down.

06:33:14.630 --> 06:33:16.030
Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: It's very matigas.

06:33:18.090 --> 06:33:23.520
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Very what? Then you can unseat one of the lawyers seated beside you so that you can have a softer seat.

06:33:24.020 --> 06:33:25.840
Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan: I'm sorry, Your Honor, it's also matigas.

06:33:28.250 --> 06:33:33.370
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: I cannot do anything about that anymore, Attorney Lorna. Senator Judge Villanueva, you may proceed.

06:33:33.610 --> 06:33:40.470
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Thank you, Mr. Presiding Officer. Thank you, Mr. President. Good afternoon,

06:33:40.710 --> 06:33:40.950
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Your Honor.

06:33:42.390 --> 06:33:51.830
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Binanggit niyo ho kanina na ilang beses kayong umaten dun sa board meetings ng, if I'm not mistaken, Metro City Chow. Nakakita niyo po ba o napansin si VP Sara?

06:33:52.290 --> 06:33:55.850
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Wala po siya when I attended the board meetings.

06:33:56.210 --> 06:33:57.570
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Dalawang beses lang po kayong umaten?

06:33:58.250 --> 06:33:58.810
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes.

06:33:59.150 --> 06:34:02.570
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Both Metro Chow and GenCorp?

06:34:04.370 --> 06:34:06.850
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: I cannot remember for GenCorp.

06:34:08.900 --> 06:34:13.650
Sen. Joel Villanueva: And ano yung ginawa niyo po nung umaten doon kayo? Observer lang or?

06:34:14.030 --> 06:34:15.110
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: No. You

06:34:15.110 --> 06:34:15.490
Sen. Joel Villanueva: take notes?

06:34:15.930 --> 06:34:22.470
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: I actually advise the board for some important things.

06:34:22.790 --> 06:34:23.230
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Like?

06:34:24.720 --> 06:34:27.960
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: It involves incident po in the branch.

06:34:29.590 --> 06:34:37.170
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Nag-i-review din po ba kayo ng mga dokumento na pinapakita during that meeting?

06:34:38.080 --> 06:34:41.360
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: During that particular meeting, yes.

06:34:41.440 --> 06:34:41.980
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Yes,

06:34:42.260 --> 06:34:42.660
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: I did.

06:34:43.290 --> 06:34:48.190
Sen. Joel Villanueva: And ni-review niyo? You cover written notes, ma'am? Consents? Resolutions?

06:34:48.970 --> 06:34:52.290
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: No, I was reviewing insurance contract.

06:34:52.690 --> 06:35:11.410
Sen. Joel Villanueva: I'm asking this question kasi kanina binabanggit nung prosecution na naka-attend kayo. Hindi naman ibig sabihin na kung hindi niyo nakita ang vice-presidente, hindi rin ibig sabihin na wala siyang participation. So ang question ko, through written approvals, meron po ba kayo na nakita, na-examine, na...

06:35:12.990 --> 06:35:14.410
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Participasyon ng Vice President?

06:35:15.010 --> 06:35:15.610
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: None.

06:35:15.990 --> 06:35:16.790
Sen. Joel Villanueva: None at all?

06:35:17.070 --> 06:35:17.750
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: None at all.

06:35:19.460 --> 06:35:36.700
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Madam Witness, dun po sa 2022 to 2025, yung GenCorp or Metro City Chow, pay or credit any amount to the Vice President or her spouse? Or pay any unexpense or either person's behalf?

06:35:37.810 --> 06:35:38.410
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: I am

06:35:38.410 --> 06:35:40.250
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: not sure what you mean, Your Honor. I'm sorry.

06:35:40.590 --> 06:35:41.630
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Kung meron pong entry,

06:35:41.950 --> 06:35:54.730
