06:35:55.990 --> 06:35:59.090
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Are you pertaining to the journal entry po ba, Your Honor?

06:35:59.410 --> 06:36:05.430
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Whatever it is, but yes, including the journal entry. Kung meron po na ibigay.

06:36:05.930 --> 06:36:07.590
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Or na

06:36:07.590 --> 06:36:17.060
Sen. Joel Villanueva: credit, kasi meron kayong pinadala sa amin na kanina itong dalawang pirasong papel about Times Square.

06:36:17.850 --> 06:36:23.970
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: I do not know about the particular journal entry for those transactions, Your Honor.

06:36:24.150 --> 06:36:31.410
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Uulitin ko lang po, kasi kung dividend nga po ito, we wanted to know when it was declared. And you were saying hindi nag-declare ng dividend.

06:36:31.750 --> 06:36:33.030
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: No dividends were declared.

06:36:33.150 --> 06:36:47.300
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Kung advance or reimbursement naman po ito, and we wanted to find out. Ano yung expense? Kasi hindi ko alam talaga kung maintindihan itong mga payments na ito. Can you help us understand what this is?

06:36:48.800 --> 06:36:58.000
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes, it is straightforward lang po na list of summary or summary ng transactions, summary ng disbursements to the Vice President.

06:36:58.340 --> 06:37:05.800
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Kasi po kung gusto naming matrace from the corporate books to the Vice President or her spouse,

06:37:07.770 --> 06:37:11.030
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Doon namin malalaman na true you or to the corporate secretary.

06:37:13.140 --> 06:37:13.720
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Is

06:37:13.720 --> 06:37:14.040
Sen. Joel Villanueva: that correct?

06:37:16.250 --> 06:37:54.640
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Binabanggit niyo po kasi, ulitin ko lang po, binabanggit niyo po kasi yung return of capital and I've studied accountancy for many years also. Magaling yung UST sa accountancy. Hindi ko na-encounter itong return of capital. Pag sinabing return of capital, ang pagkakaintindi ko po, return to the original lang na inilagay. Kung ang inilagay at binabanggit po ng mga kapwa ko, Senador, 48,000, naging 2.1 million, aba, eh hindi na po, return on capital na po yan, di ho ba? Would you agree with me?

06:37:56.860 --> 06:38:05.140
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: As I stated earlier po, I do not know if there were additional investments after the Vice President.

06:38:06.030 --> 06:38:13.600
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Even if, sorry mama, sorry to interrupt. Even if, na hindi nyo alam, kung meron, then it's return on capital.

06:38:14.820 --> 06:38:17.620
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: It would depend on how much is the capital.

06:38:19.420 --> 06:38:34.840
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Napakagaling ho kasi. 48,000 naging 2.1 million. Dapat yung Maharlika, i-hire po yung mga executive ng GenCorp. Kasi maharli ka hanggang ngayon, di kumikita. Going back to this particular issue,

06:38:36.470 --> 06:38:50.990
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Binanggit niyo na po kanina, kita ito, kumita po. As I think Senator Riza was asking the question kanina. Binanggit niyo, kumita na. So, income po. And if you look at the definition of income, money earned by investment. So, you agree?

06:38:51.450 --> 06:38:52.010
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes, po.

06:38:52.210 --> 06:39:29.810
Sen. Joel Villanueva: So, income po ito. Kasi kanina hindi niyo binabanggit na income. At kung income po, mukhang delikado po kasi klaro yung sa Constitution. Last... Question, Mr. Presiding Officer, and I'm winding up. I was looking at the GIS of GenCorp, Your Honor, and in the 2025 GIS, there are zero, zero rank and file employees. Zero. Ah, noong 2023 and 2024, may dalawa pong empleyado.

06:39:31.360 --> 06:40:21.130
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Nagugulumihanan po ako bilang Hepe ng Committee on Labor dito sa Senado. Meron po kayong binanggit kanina about Compensation Committee. Paano kayong nagkaroon ng Compensation Committee kung wala po kayong nakalistang empleyado, Madam Witness? Paano kayo kumita ng higit isang daang milyon? na wala pong empleyado. Dalawang empleyado 2022 and 2023 at nasa 74 million ng inyong assets. Kung kailan pa lumaki to more than 100 million tsaka walang naging empleyado. Hindi ko lang humaintindihan. Can you help me understand being the counsel for GenCorp?

06:40:22.400 --> 06:40:44.410
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: As I said earlier po, I am not the one who prepared the general information sheets and admittedly it's really not perfect so I do not know if I can offer an explanation that's enough for you because I do not also know kung bakit naging ganyan naging zero ang rank and file.

06:40:45.590 --> 06:41:09.960
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Salamat po for being honest pero yung not perfect parang hindi ko kayang tanggapin kasi zero employee parang Mahira po tanggapin, but I will take your answer. Maraming pong salamat. I just, again, I'm alarmed dito sa mga issue na ito, lalo na sa usapin ng ating mga manggagawa. Maraming salamat. Thank you, Mr. Thank

06:41:09.960 --> 06:41:14.980
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: you, Senator Judge Joel. The Senate President is recognized. You have two minutes, sir. May procedo niyo, ready?

06:41:15.220 --> 06:41:16.520
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Thank you, Mr.

06:41:19.810 --> 06:41:22.890
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: President Officer. Magandang hapang, attorney.

