Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Itong ang nagbabayad ngayon, itong quote-unquote loose investment ay GenCorp.

06:42:15.350 --> 06:42:16.570
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes, it's GenCorp.

06:42:16.650 --> 06:42:18.990
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Lumalabas po ito sa kahan ng GenCorp.

06:42:19.310 --> 06:42:20.070
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes, sir.

06:42:20.490 --> 06:42:38.940
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: At narinig ko kanina dahil nga ang investment lang po ng VP Sara sa Davao Bounty, yung pinakaunang-unang investment ay 46,000 tapos ang lumalabas pong ang binayaran na po ng GenCorp ay 2.1 million pesos.

06:42:40.580 --> 06:42:59.110
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Lumalabas na hindi po ito pagbabalik ng puhunan. Ito ay kita doon sa puhunan. Dahil nga 46,000 lang linigay niya, ibinalik niya 2.1 million. Ngayon, dahil GenCorp, lumalabas ito sa kahan ng GenCorp.

06:43:02.840 --> 06:43:10.660
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Tapos ang GenCorp, sa mga huling hearing, nagbebenta rin po ng pagkain sa Davao LGU.

06:43:12.230 --> 06:43:16.290
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: 19 contracts between 2022 to 2025.

06:43:17.940 --> 06:43:34.990
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: So, tingin nyo, hindi ba ito Conflict of Interest na ang GenCorp nagbabayad ng investment, loose investment kay Vice President Sara pero sa kabilang banda nagbebenta naman siya sa Davao LGU.

06:43:36.600 --> 06:43:50.560
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: With respect to the 19 contracts with the LGU, These were served by the Bolton Branch, which is the closest branch to the City Hall.

06:43:50.780 --> 06:43:51.420
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Sino

06:43:51.420 --> 06:43:52.980
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: may-ari ng Bolton Branch?

06:43:53.620 --> 06:43:54.660
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: GenCorp din po.

06:43:55.120 --> 06:43:57.780
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: At ang GenCorp nagbabayad kay VP Sara?

06:43:58.680 --> 06:44:00.980
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes, from the Times Square earnings.

06:44:01.780 --> 06:44:03.080
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Hindi naman,

06:44:03.500 --> 06:44:06.680
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: sakahan niyang GenCorp, lumalabas yung pera, tama po ba?

06:44:07.120 --> 06:44:11.340
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes, but each branch has its own bank account.

06:44:11.980 --> 06:44:14.680
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Hindi, but hindi, sinong korporasyon ang nagbabayad kay

06:44:14.680 --> 06:44:15.160
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: DP-SARA?

06:44:15.240 --> 06:44:15.700
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: It's still GenCorp.

06:44:15.740 --> 06:44:16.200
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: GenCorp,

06:44:16.420 --> 06:44:19.060
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: tama ho. Sino ang nagbebenta sa DAWA-LGU?

06:44:19.740 --> 06:44:20.340
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: GenCorp.

06:44:20.360 --> 06:44:23.990
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: GenCorp. So mukhang conflict of interest.

06:44:24.530 --> 06:44:26.010
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: With conflict of interest.

06:44:26.150 --> 06:44:26.610
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Dahil sa

06:44:26.610 --> 06:44:36.550
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: kabilang banda, in investment, binabayaran, in kita sa investment, sa kabilang banda naman, nagbebenta ng pagkain sa DAWA-LGU.

06:44:38.130 --> 06:44:44.850
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: To my understanding, there's no conflict of interest because Pipi Sara is not part of the LGU.

06:44:46.910 --> 06:44:52.810
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Pero ang kanyang kapatid ay mayor ng Davao LGU.

06:44:54.210 --> 06:44:54.770
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes,

06:44:54.770 --> 06:44:55.910
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: that is correct, Your Honor.

06:44:56.370 --> 06:45:38.580
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Tinignan ko rin kanina itong binigay niyong datos, itong flash lang sa screen. Kung ito po ay balik ng puhunan, bakit po every month? nagbabayad at iba-iba po yung amounts. Di ba kung balik ng puhunan yan, assuming 4 gives, equal payments yan ginagawa, maybe one time every year. Bakit every month, iba-iba yung amount, iba-iba yung amount every month, iba-iba yung amount every year, at obviously mas malaki po sa 46,000 yung pagbayad.

06:45:41.030 --> 06:45:41.790
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes,

06:45:44.390 --> 06:46:05.510
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Your Honor. And as I said earlier, I do not know if there were additional investments aside from the 46,000. And sa disbursements naman, I have no personal knowledge regarding how these disbursements were computed. But as you can see, almost

06:46:08.040 --> 06:46:09.920
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: monthly except for 2024.

06:46:13.180 --> 06:46:28.900
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Oo nga, pero parang hindi ho tugma na babalik mo yung puhunan, pero ho, every month, iba-iba yung amount. Anong formula ho yung gamit nila? Anong naging basis nitong every month na iba-iba yung amount?

06:46:29.420 --> 06:46:33.680
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: I have no personal knowledge regarding the formula used, Your Honor.

06:46:33.850 --> 06:46:35.190
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Dahil wala po yung kontrata.

06:46:35.770 --> 06:46:38.010
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Wala po talaga ako nakita ng kontrata.

06:46:38.010 --> 06:46:50.030
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Yun po yung nakakapagtaka dahil may investment pero walang kontrata. At lastly, Paano po rinirecord ng GenCorp sa kanilang libro itong pagbalik ng 2.1 million pesos?

06:46:51.340 --> 06:47:00.300
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes, regarding the journal entries, as I mentioned earlier, I also have no personal knowledge because this is handled by our accounting department.

06:47:01.260 --> 06:47:03.380
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Pero accountant rin kayo, di ba?

06:47:04.050 --> 06:47:07.510
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes, Your Honor, but I do not do the books of GenCorp.

06:47:07.570 --> 06:47:24.760
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Pero dapat inalam niyo kung paano rinirecord sa libro. Ito ba ho ay... What do you say? Loose investment? Kaya sa ngayon, nagmumukha siyang bayad sa kita. In other words, kita ko ito ni Vice President.

06:47:26.980 --> 06:47:30.320
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Pwede niyo bang masabi kung anong naging entry sa libro?

06:47:31.040 --> 06:47:33.940
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: I do not know the entries in the books, Your Honor. I'm sorry.

06:47:34.420 --> 06:47:37.200
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: All right. Thank you. Thank you, Mr. Presiding Officer.

06:47:39.050 --> 06:47:48.650
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Senator Judge Bam Aquino is recognized. You have two minutes, sir. You may proceed when you're ready. For the information of the senator, judges, and the parties, we have

06:47:50.410 --> 06:47:59.790
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: six more interventions, probably more, and we will finish with this before we adjourn today's trial.

06:48:01.540 --> 06:48:03.340
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Maraming salamat, Mr. Presiding Officer.

06:48:04.920 --> 06:48:05.740
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Good afternoon,

06:48:07.340 --> 06:48:07.600
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Your Honor.

06:48:08.600 --> 06:48:15.740
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Marami po sa mga tanong ko, natanong na rin ng iba, and if you notice po, marami sa kanila, clarificatory lang talaga.

06:48:18.020 --> 06:48:43.460
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Sa inyo pong testimonya, lumabas na or nakumpirma na meron pong natatanggap na pera si Vice President Sara sa GenCorp. First time po namin ito narinig, na na-confirm po ito. Kaya marami pong tanong talaga. And a lot of my questions will be around GenCorp and Metro Chow. So, let's go first to Metro Chow. Si Metro Chow po, kasama po si Vice President Sara sa mga incorporators, correct no?

06:48:43.640 --> 06:48:44.120
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Correct.

06:48:44.160 --> 06:48:44.600
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Until

06:48:44.600 --> 06:48:44.860
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: now.

06:48:46.900 --> 06:48:52.660
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Incorporators po kasi is hindi siya nag-change, pero yes, stockholder pa rin po si VP Sara.

06:48:52.660 --> 06:48:52.900
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay, so

06:48:52.900 --> 06:48:53.900
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: she's a current stockholder.

06:48:54.100 --> 06:48:54.240
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: What

06:48:54.240 --> 06:48:55.060
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: is the nature

06:48:55.060 --> 06:48:57.080
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: of business of Metro Chow? Food?

06:48:57.340 --> 06:48:58.200
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Chow King po.

06:48:58.380 --> 06:49:01.760
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: So Chow King siya. Ilang branch ang meron sa Metro Chow?

06:49:01.920 --> 06:49:02.560
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Isa lang po.

06:49:02.720 --> 06:49:05.760
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: One branch. Can you confirm kung ano yung address ng branch na ito?

06:49:06.060 --> 06:49:08.100
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: San Pedro Street, Davao City.

06:49:08.480 --> 06:49:17.920
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay. Si Vice President Sara ba meron natatanggap na pera? Mula sa Metro Chow, gaya ng kanyang pagtanggap na monthly mula sa GenCorp?

06:49:18.100 --> 06:49:18.560
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Wala po.

06:49:18.800 --> 06:49:20.160
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: So wala siyang natatanggap?

06:49:20.260 --> 06:49:20.700
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Wala po.

06:49:20.880 --> 06:49:24.240
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Do you know how much ang investment ni Vice President Sara sa Metro Chow?

06:49:25.520 --> 06:49:35.340
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Investment, I would know the initial capitalization lang based sa Articles of Incorporation which is, if I remember it correctly po, 12,500.

06:49:35.880 --> 06:49:48.170
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: So as we know, Meron namang pagbayad para mag-incorporate pero usually iba rin naman yung investment. So 12-5 ang nasa SEC documents. You don't know kung magkano yung investment.

06:49:48.490 --> 06:49:48.930
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes, Your Honor.

06:49:49.190 --> 06:49:55.730
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Alam niyo ba kung magkano yung investment ni VP Sara sa Davao Bounty na naging GenCorp?

06:49:56.150 --> 06:49:56.930
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Hindi po.

06:49:57.250 --> 06:49:58.070
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Hindi niyo rin alam?

06:49:58.150 --> 06:49:58.550
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Hindi po.

06:49:58.610 --> 06:50:05.310
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Pero dito sa GenCorp, meron siyang natatanggap na pera. Sa Metro Chow, wala siyang natatanggap na pera pero pareho siya nag-invest.

06:50:06.330 --> 06:50:06.850
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes.

06:50:07.110 --> 06:50:15.680
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Can you explain? Hazard a guess kung bakit sa isa, pareho naman siyang investor pero dito sa isa may kinikita siya, dito sa kabila wala naman siyang kinikita?

06:50:17.790 --> 06:50:20.850
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Metro City Chow is losing po.

06:50:21.210 --> 06:50:25.070
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Is losing. Okay. So si GenCorp is making money?

06:50:26.820 --> 06:50:28.980
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: May net income po si GenCorp.

06:50:29.160 --> 06:50:31.740
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: So si Metro Chow negative ang kanyang submission sa BIR?

06:50:32.040 --> 06:50:33.060
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Until 2024.

06:50:33.900 --> 06:50:48.840
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay. So, okay. With that answer, we can surmise na itong pumapasok ay nakadepende. Kung may kita o wala. In fact, if I may ask the tech to put up the chart, yung 2022 to 2025.

06:50:52.900 --> 06:50:53.860
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Pakiakyat po yung chart.

06:50:59.800 --> 06:51:01.800
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Tigil nyo naman yung time ko, Annika.

06:51:04.280 --> 06:51:05.800
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Pababa pa rin yung time ko, Annika.

06:51:09.760 --> 06:51:10.180
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Sige.

06:51:12.320 --> 06:51:57.060
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay ba? Wala? Okay. Sige. Ito na lang po. If you look at the chart, sa December, ang laki ng increase nung disbursement kay VP Sara. Which, you know, because you can't confirm kung ano to, ang nasa isip namin, ito'y dahil pag December, mataas ang sales. Di ba? Mataas ang sales ng mga Jollibee pag December, so malaki rin yung kita niya. So, ito, kita ito. Kumbaga, porsyento to ng kita. And I would suggest, Terni Suzette, dahil left-hanging to, you can still, through the defense, give us an answer kung paano ba to nakukompute. Kasi iba po yung pautang na binabayaran. Iba yung monthly, may kinikita base sa profit o base sa income ng kumpanya. Alam nyo naman po na ibang-iba po yan.

06:51:57.320 --> 06:51:57.820
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes, Your Honor.

06:51:58.080 --> 06:51:58.280
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay.

06:52:00.140 --> 06:52:04.900
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay, let's go to these amounts. How are these distributed to the Vice President?

06:52:05.840 --> 06:52:07.060
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Through checks po.

06:52:07.320 --> 06:52:08.960
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Through checks. And these checks are deposited?

06:52:10.480 --> 06:52:11.000
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Probably...

06:52:14.040 --> 06:52:16.760
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: On the part of VP Sara, I think deposited.

06:52:17.560 --> 06:52:23.060
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Well, pwede namang ibalik. Pwede namang hindi dineposit. Hindi ko

06:52:23.060 --> 06:52:23.500
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: alam.

06:52:23.620 --> 06:52:36.930
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: But are there checks that have gone back to GenCorp? Kapag ganun yun, di ba? Pag hindi, tama ba? Pag hindi dineposit? But can you confirm that these monies went out of the company?

06:52:41.070 --> 06:52:46.590
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: I cannot confirm because I'm not part of the accounting but it is the data that was extracted.

06:52:47.050 --> 06:52:57.050
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay. So itong 2.1 million, ito yung nilabas ng GenCorp but you're also not confirming kung tinanggap nga ito o... Kasi cheque ang binigay o bank deposit? Just to be clear.

06:52:57.390 --> 06:52:57.950
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Cheque.

06:52:58.130 --> 06:53:25.340
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Cheque. Okay. Sige. Maybe a last question. Before 2022, can you confirm kung merong natanggap na... Sasabihin ko yun lang pera kasi we might argue about the classification of these monies. Before 2022 and after 2025, can you confirm kung merong natanggap na pera or may nailabas na pera ang GenCorp para kay Vice President Sara?

06:53:25.520 --> 06:53:31.140
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: I cannot be certain kasi ang pina-extract ko is 2022 to 2025.

06:53:31.900 --> 06:53:53.170
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay. So last point lang Mr. Presiding Officer. Atty. Suzette, and to the defense, kapag hindi ko kumpleto yung datos, we are left to speculate kung ano yan. So kung di mo makakonfirm, posibleng, when was Davao Bounty Incorporated? 2003?

06:53:53.550 --> 06:53:54.250
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: 2007.

06:53:54.770 --> 06:54:47.850
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: So posibleng from 2007 to 2021, Meron siyang natatanggap na pera and possibly in 2026, meron siyang natatanggap na pera. We cannot confirm that this is the whole amount that was disbursed to her because you also cannot confirm kung magkano talaga yung nailabas at naibigay sa kanya. And Mr. Presiding Officer, hindi pa naman tapos ang lahat, meron pa namang summation ng defense. They can confirm these amounts before the end of the trial and we would like to see that. Under oath, kung meron bang ibang pera ang pumasok, kung ito ba'y tinanggap, ito ba'y na-deposito at hindi, at ano yung formula ng pag-compute nito. Kung ito ba'y based on sales or based on, although I doubt it, kung based on an installment plan for return on investment. Yun lang po, Mr. Presiding Officer.

06:54:48.330 --> 06:54:50.070
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: What is the pleasure of attorney, Mike?

06:54:50.460 --> 06:54:54.680
Atty. Michael Wesley Poa: Thank you. May I be recognized just briefly, just to respond, Your Honor? Yes,

06:54:54.840 --> 06:54:55.460
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: briefly,

06:54:55.560 --> 06:54:55.980
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: counsel.

06:54:56.040 --> 06:55:16.760
Atty. Michael Wesley Poa: We understand the questions of the good senators, all the senators, and we understand that there are probably gaps that you want filled, and so we would like to inform the Honorable Court that we will present the proper witness at the proper time before we close our presentation of evidence-in-chief to answer those questions, Your Honors. That is all, Your Honor.

06:55:16.840 --> 06:55:17.700
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Thank you, Attorney Mike.

06:55:19.360 --> 06:55:23.880
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Senator Judge Camille Villar is recognized. You have two minutes, ma'am. You may proceed when you're ready.

06:55:28.370 --> 06:55:29.970
Sen. Camille Villar: Hi, Atty. Suzette.

06:55:30.170 --> 06:55:32.270
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Magandang hapon po. Good afternoon, Your Honor.

06:55:32.470 --> 06:55:57.230
Sen. Camille Villar: Yes, I just have a few, again, clarificatory questions. And I beg for your indulgence because maybe some of these questions have already been asked. But again, I just needed to refresh my memory and so I can make a more informed decision. There was a lot kasi of discussion kanina about the revenues of GenCorp sales, di ba?

06:55:59.020 --> 06:56:26.080
Sen. Camille Villar: From 2021, ang sales niya is 28,087,703. Tapos sa 2022, revenues lang po ito, so sales lang, naging 300. Tapos sa 2023, naging 320. And then sa 2024, naging 394 million yung benta niya, yung sales or yung revenues, di ba?

06:56:26.240 --> 06:56:26.620
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes,

06:56:26.620 --> 06:56:26.880
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Your Honor.

06:56:27.980 --> 06:56:42.900
Sen. Camille Villar: And as I recall, kaya lumaki yung benta, na-explain nyo naman, is because nadagdagan po ba yung branches ng GenCorp somewhere between 2021 and 2022?

06:56:43.680 --> 06:56:44.560
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes, Your Honor.

06:56:44.820 --> 06:56:45.680
Sen. Camille Villar: So from how

06:56:45.680 --> 06:56:49.820
Sen. Camille Villar: many branches would you know?

06:56:50.080 --> 06:56:54.640
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: So in 2021, one branch. In 2022,

06:56:56.840 --> 06:57:05.340
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: January, isang branch. February, isang branch. June, isang branch. And then next is 2024, another branch.

06:57:05.660 --> 06:57:07.780
Sen. Camille Villar: Ah, okay. So, it's possible na,

06:57:07.900 --> 06:57:20.200
Sen. Camille Villar: I mean, kaya nag-increase yung sales exponentially is because, syempre, every branch that's added, meron siyang karagdagang or corresponding sales, hindi po ba?

06:57:20.420 --> 06:57:20.820
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes

06:57:20.820 --> 06:57:21.000
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: po.

06:57:21.340 --> 06:57:58.900
Sen. Camille Villar: And so, na-explain niyo naman po yun kanina. That's very clear to me. And then, with regard to the income, di ba? The reason why the income na lang of the company is because as we know naman, yung kita ng kumpanya is yung benta or yung sales, less the expenses, less everything like labor, cost of goods, everything. And then ang ending is ang net income nung 2021 is just 182,000. Nung kumpanya. Parang ganun.

06:58:02.870 --> 06:58:03.610
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: For

06:58:06.620 --> 06:58:09.260
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: 2021, your honor?

06:58:09.560 --> 06:58:10.100
Sen. Camille Villar: Yes.

06:58:14.530 --> 06:58:15.630
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes, your honor.

06:58:15.870 --> 06:59:09.940
Sen. Camille Villar: Di ba? Tapos sa 2022, 1.8 million. And 2.7 nung 2023. Tapos nung 2024, 3.3... Parang 3,324,863. And, siguro, one could deduce na, ah, I'll just wrap up, just one or two questions, na kasi diba, benta could be 300 million. Pero pwedeng maraming expenses, tumaas na ang presyo ng pagkain, tumaas na ang presyo ng kuryente, tumaas na ang presyo ng labor, kung kaya't mahirap mag-operate ng business at kaya pwedeng mababa na lang yung kita. Diba? And in some cases nga, wala nang kita or malulugi pa yung negosyo or negative po yan. Hindi po ba?

06:59:10.330 --> 06:59:11.250
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Normal in business.

06:59:11.390 --> 06:59:12.010
Sen. Camille Villar: Di ba? Normal

06:59:12.010 --> 06:59:28.120
Sen. Camille Villar: in business yun. So, especially now, I can imagine na ganun kahirap yun. So, it's really possible na you can have sales in the hundreds of millions, pero yung bottom line can be very, very low or even negative. Hindi po ba?

06:59:28.340 --> 06:59:29.000
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: It's possible.

06:59:29.000 --> 06:59:47.160
Sen. Camille Villar: So yun lang yung mga iniisip ko when I was thinking back in our case. So this was with regard to GenCorp. And then last na lang po to because I think I'm taking so much of the time. Ma'am, Atty. Suzette, kayo po ay ang in-house corporate counsel ng GenCorp and Metro City.

06:59:47.480 --> 06:59:48.220
Atty. Suzette Balucanag-Punay: Yes, Your Honor.

